msgctxt "BlandAltman|"
msgid ""
"Pairs of scale variables to compare. Each pair produces a Bland-Altman plot "
"of the mean versus the difference between measurements."
msgstr ""
"Pasangan variabel skala untuk membandingkan. Setiap pasangan memproduksikan "
"diagram Bland-Altman dari rerata versus perbedaan antara pengukuran."

msgctxt "BlandAltman|"
msgid ""
"Display confidence intervals around the mean difference and its upper and "
"lower limits of agreement in the plot."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan interval kepercayaan sekitar perbedaan rerata dan batas atas dan "
"bawah dari perjanjiannya di diagram."

msgctxt "BlandAltman|"
msgid ""
"Shade the confidence interval regions around the mean difference and limits "
"of agreement."
msgstr ""
"Arsirkan wilayah interval kepercayaan sekitar perbedaan rerata dan batas "
"perjanjian."

msgctxt "BlandAltman|"
msgid "Use colour (rather than grey) to fill the shaded confidence regions."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan warna (dari pada abu-abu) untuk mengisi wilayah kepercayaan diarsir."

msgctxt "BlandAltman|"
msgid ""
"Table showing the mean difference, the upper and lower limits of agreement, "
"and their confidence intervals."
msgstr ""
"Tabel menampilkan perbedaan rerata, batas atas dan bawah dari perjanjian, "
"dan interval kepercayaan mereka."

msgctxt "IntraclassCorrelation|"
msgid ""
"Rating variables to include. Each variable is one rater; each row is a "
"subject being rated."
msgstr ""
"Variabel tingkat disertakan. Setiap variabel adalah satu penilai; setiap "
"baris adalah subjek sedang dinilai."

msgctxt "IntraclassCorrelation|"
msgid ""
"Determines the ICC model. ICC(1): each subject rated by a different random "
"rater. ICC(2): all subjects rated by the same random sample of raters. "
"ICC(3): all subjects rated by the same fixed raters. See Shrout & Fleiss "
"(1979)."
msgstr ""
"Menentukan model ICC. ICC(1): setiap subjek dinilai oleh penilai acak "
"berbeda. ICC(2): semua subjek dinilai oleh sampel dari penilai acak sama. "
"ICC(3): semua subjek dinilai oleh penilai tetap sama. Lihat Shrout & Fleiss "
"(1979)."

msgctxt "IntraclassCorrelation|"
msgid ""
"When ratings are averaged across raters, the k-rater version of the selected "
"ICC is computed (e.g. ICC(2,k) instead of ICC(2,1)) per Shrout & Fleiss "
"(1979). Averaging generally raises the reliability estimate."
msgstr ""
"Ketika penilaian dirata-ratakan seluruh penilai, versi penilai-k dari ICC "
"terpilih dihitung (cth. ICC(2,k) dan bukan ICC(2,1)) per Shrout & Fleiss "
"(1979). Merata-rata secara umum meningkatkan estimasi reliabilitas."

msgctxt "IntraclassCorrelation|"
msgid ""
"Report a confidence interval for the ICC estimate based on the F-"
"distribution."
msgstr ""
"Laporkan interval kepercayaan untuk estimasi ICC berdasarkan distribusi-F."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid "All variables available in the dataset."
msgstr "Semua variabel tersedia di rangkaian data."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid ""
"Rating variables to include. Whether a variable represents a rater or a "
"subject/item depends on the data structure setting."
msgstr ""
"Variabel penilaian disertakan. Apakah variabel merepresentasikan penilai "
"atau subjek/item tergantung pada pengaturan struktur data."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid ""
"Specify whether raters are arranged in columns (default) or rows in the "
"dataset."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan apakah penilai disesuaikan di kolom (bawaan) atau baris di "
"rangkaian data."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid ""
"Each column is one rater and each row is one subject or item being rated."
msgstr ""
"Setiap kolom adalah satu penilai dan setiap baris adalah satu objek atau "
"item sedang dinilai."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid ""
"Each row is one rater and each column is one subject or item being rated."
msgstr ""
"Setiap baris adalah satu penilai dan setiap kolom adalah satu objek atau "
"item sedang dinilai."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid ""
"Measures agreement between exactly two raters. When more than two raters are "
"entered, all pairwise combinations are computed."
msgstr ""
"Mengukur perjanjian antara dua penilai secara tepat. Ketika lebih dari dua "
"penilai dimasukkan, semau kombinasi berpasangan dihitung."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid ""
"Unweighted kappa treats all disagreements equally. Weighted kappa accounts "
"for the degree of disagreement and requires ordinal ratings."
msgstr ""
"Kappa tidak berberat memperlakukan semua pertidaksetujuan secara sama. Kappa "
"berberat menghitung untuk derajat dari pertidaksetujuan dan memerlukan "
"tingkat ordinal."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid "All disagreements are treated as equal regardless of their magnitude."
msgstr ""
"Semua pertidaksetujuan diperlakukan sebagai persamaan terlepas dari "
"magnitudo mereka."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid ""
"Disagreements are penalised according to their magnitude. Requires ordinal "
"ratings."
msgstr ""
"Pertidaksetujuan dipenalisasikan menurut magnitudo mereka. Memerlukan "
"tingkat ordinal."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid "Weighting scheme applied to disagreements between ordinal categories."
msgstr "Skema berberat diterapkan ke pertidaksetujuan antara kategori ordinal."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid ""
"Penalises larger disagreements quadratically; sensitive to large "
"discrepancies."
msgstr ""
"Mempenalisasikan pertidaksetujuan lebih besar secara kuadratik; sensitif ke "
"diskrepansi besar."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid "Penalises disagreements proportionally to their size."
msgstr ""
"Mempenalisasikan pertidaksetujuan secara proporsional ke ukuran mereka."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid ""
"Measures agreement among two or more raters. Applicable to nominal, ordinal, "
"interval, or ratio data."
msgstr ""
"Mengukur perjanjian dengan dua atau lebih peringkat. Dapat diterapkan ke "
"data nominal, ordinal, interval, atau rasio."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid ""
"Level of measurement determines how disagreements are quantified in the "
"alpha calculation."
msgstr ""
"Tingkat dari pengukuran menentukan bagaimana pertidaksetujuan dihitung di "
"perhitungan alfa."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid "Kendall's W"
msgstr "W Kendall"

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid ""
"Measures concordance among multiple raters on ordinal rankings. Ranges from "
"0 (no agreement) to 1 (perfect agreement)."
msgstr ""
"Mengukur konkordansi dengan beberapa penilai pada peringkat ordinal. Rentang "
"dari 0 (tidak ada perjanjian) ke 1 (perjanjian sempurna)."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid "Correct for ties"
msgstr "Koreksi untuk persamaan"

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid ""
"Apply a correction to Kendall's W when tied ranks are present in the data. "
"Recommended whenever ties can occur."
msgstr ""
"Terapkan koreksi ke W Kendall ketika peringkat sama ditampilkan di data. "
"Direkomendasikan kapan pun persamaan dapat terjadi."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid ""
"Measures agreement among two or more raters on nominal categories. "
"Generalises Cohen's kappa to multiple raters."
msgstr ""
"Mengukur perjanjian antara dua atau lebih penilai pada kategori nominal. Men-"
"generalisasikan kappa Cohen ke beberapa penilai."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid "Advanced Options"
msgstr "Opsi Lanjutan"

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid "Options for confidence intervals and bootstrap settings."
msgstr "Opsi untuk interval kepercayaan dan pengaturan bootstrap."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid "Confidence interval"
msgstr "Interval kepercayaan"

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid ""
"Report a confidence interval for each agreement coefficient. Cohen's kappa "
"and Fleiss' kappa use asymptotic CIs; Krippendorff's alpha and Kendall's W "
"use bootstrap CIs."
msgstr ""
"Laporkan interval kepercayaan untuk setiap koefisien perjanjian. Kappa Cohen "
"dan kappa Fleiss menggunakan CI asimptotik; alfa Krippendorff dan W Kendall "
"menggunakan CI bootstrap."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid "Width of the confidence interval."
msgstr "Lebar dari interval kepercayaan."

msgctxt "RaterAgreement|"
msgid ""
"Number of bootstrap replications used to compute confidence intervals. "
"Higher values give more stable estimates. Only applies to Krippendorff's "
"alpha and Kendall's W, whose CIs are bootstrap-based."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah replikasi bootstrap digunakan untuk menghitung interval kepercayaan. "
"Nilai lebih tinggi memberikan estimasi lebih stabil. Hanya menerapkan ke "
"alfa Krippendorff dan W Kendall, yang CI berdasarkan bootstrap."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"Items to include in the SEM analysis. Must be ordinally or nominally scaled "
"(dichotomous or polytomous)."
msgstr ""
"Item disertakan di analisis SEM. Harus diskalakan secara ordinal atau secara "
"nominal (dikotomus atau politomus)."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"CTT-based methods that split the test into parts to estimate the conditional "
"error variance per sum score."
msgstr ""
"Metode berbasis CTT yang memisahkan uji menjadi bagian untuk mengestimasikan "
"varians galat kondisional per skor jumlah."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"Splits items into odd- and even-numbered halves. Reorder variables in the "
"list to change the split."
msgstr ""
"Memisahkan item menjadi sebagian berangka ganjil dan genap. Urutkan ulang "
"varians di daftar untuk mengubah pemisahan."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"Splits items into multiple equal parts to estimate error variance per score "
"group."
msgstr ""
"Memisahkan item menjadi beberapa bagian sama untuk mengestimasikan varians "
"galat per grup skor."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"How many equal parts to split the test into. Must be a divisor of the number "
"of items."
msgstr ""
"Seberapa banya bagian untuk memisahkan uji. Harus berupa pembagi dari jumlah "
"item."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"Splits items into parts and models score differences with polynomial "
"regression to estimate the conditional SEM."
msgstr ""
"Memisahkan item menjadi bagian dan perbedaan skor model dengan regresi "
"polinomial untuk mengestimasikan SEN kondisional."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"Degree of the polynomial used to predict score differences, e.g., 3 fits Y = "
"X + X² + X³."
msgstr ""
"Derajat dari polinomial digunakan untuk memprediksi perbedaan skor, cth., 3 "
"sesuai Y = X + X² + X³."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"Estimates conditional SEM from a repeated-measures ANOVA using the ICC(3,k) "
"approach (Emons, 2023)."
msgstr ""
"Mengestimasikan SEM kondisional dari ANOVA pengukuran berulang menggunakan "
"pendekatan ICC(3,k) (Emons, 2023)."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"IRT-based SEM using the 2PLM for dichotomous items or the graded response "
"model for polytomous items. Assumes a single latent variable."
msgstr ""
"SEM berbasis IRT menggunakan 2PLM untuk item dikotomus atau model tanggapan "
"bernilai untuk item politomus. Mengasumsikan variabel laten tunggal."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"Methods based on the binomial error model. Only available for dichotomous "
"(non-ordinal) items."
msgstr ""
"Metode berdasarkan model galat binomial. Hanya tersedia untuk item dikotomus "
"(non-ordinal)."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"Lord's binomial method based on the number of correct and incorrect "
"responses."
msgstr "Metode binomial Lord berdasarkan jumlah tanggapan benar dan salah."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"Keats' correction of Lord's method; uses a reliability coefficient to reduce "
"bias."
msgstr ""
"Koreksi Keats dari metode Lord; menggunakan koefisien reliabilitas untuk "
"mengurangi bias."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid "Lord's method generalised to multiple test parts."
msgstr "Metode Lord digeneralisasikan ke beberapa bagian uji."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"How many parts to split the test into. Must be a divisor of the number of "
"items (excluding the last value)."
msgstr ""
"Seberapa banya bagian untuk memisahkan uji. Harus berupa pembagi dari jumlah "
"item (mengecualikan nilai terakhir)."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"Table of sum scores with normal-theory confidence intervals computed from "
"the estimated SEM."
msgstr ""
"Tabel dari skor jumlah dengan interval kepercayaan teori normal dihitung "
"dari SEM terestimasi."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"Override the reliability estimate used for the unconditional SEM and the "
"Keats method."
msgstr ""
"Timpa estimasi reliabilitas digunakan untuk SEM tidak kondisional dan metode "
"Keats."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"Score groups with fewer observations are merged with adjacent groups before "
"estimating the SEM (default: 20). Applies to the Thorndike, Feldt, ANOVA, "
"and Lord generalized methods."
msgstr ""
"Skor grup dengan lebih sedikit observasi digabungkan dengan grup "
"bersebelahan sebelum mengestimasikan SEM (bawaan: 20). Menerapkan ke metode "
"tergeneralisasi Thorndike, Feldt, ANOVA, dan Lord."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"Hide the main SEM table showing conditional error estimates per sum score "
"and method."
msgstr ""
"Sembunyikan tabel SEM utama menampilkan estimasi galat kondisional per skor "
"jumlah dan metode."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid "Histogram of the number of respondents per sum score group."
msgstr "Histogram dari jumlah tanggapan per grup skor jumlah."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"Separate point plot per method showing the conditional SEM values across sum "
"scores."
msgstr ""
"Pisahkan diagram titik per metode menampilkan nilai SEM kondisional seluruh "
"skor jumlah."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"Combined plot displaying all methods' SEM values in a single panel for easy "
"comparison."
msgstr ""
"Diagram terkombinasi menampilkan semua nilai SEM metode di panel tunggal "
"untuk perbandingan mudah."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid ""
"Plot sum scores with confidence interval bands per method. Intervals are "
"normal-theory CIs using the estimated SEM."
msgstr ""
"Diagramkan skor jumlah dengan band interval kepercayaan per metode. Interval "
"adalah CI teori normal menggunakan SEM terestimasi."

msgctxt "StandardErrorOfMeasurement|"
msgid "Add a horizontal reference line at the specified cut score."
msgstr "Tambahkan garis referensi horizontal di skor batas ditentukan."

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Bayesian Multidimensional Reliability"
msgstr "Reliabilitas Multidimensi Bayes"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Multidimensional Reliability"
msgstr "Reliabilitas Multidimensi"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Assign the items to their factors. The analysis requires at least two "
"factors with at least two items each. An item may be assigned to more than "
"one factor (cross-loading); the bi-factor model does not support cross-"
"loadings."
msgstr ""
"Tugaskan item ke faktor mereka. Analisis memerlukan setidaknya dua faktor "
"dengan setidaknya setiap dua item. Item mungkin ditugaskan ke lebih dari "
"satu faktor (lintas-pemuatan); model bi-faktor tidak mendukung lintas-"
"pemuatan."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Model"
msgstr "Model"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Second-order"
msgstr "Urutan-kedua"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Bi-factor"
msgstr "Bi-faktor"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Correlated factors"
msgstr "Faktor terkorelasi"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"The factor model used to estimate the reliability coefficients. McDonald's "
"ω_h (general/group-common reliability) is only available for the second-"
"order and bi-factor models."
msgstr ""
"Model faktor digunakan untuk mengestimasikan koefisien reliabilitas. ω_h "
"McDonald (reliabilitas umum/grup-umum) hanya tersedia untuk model urutan "
"kedua dan bi-faktor."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Analysis"
msgstr "Analisis"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Credible interval"
msgstr "Interval kredibel"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Width of the credible interval for the reliability coefficients."
msgstr "Lebar dari interval kredibel untuk koefisien reliabilitas."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Mean and standard deviation of"
msgstr "Rerata dan deviasi standar dari"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Whether the mean and standard deviation in the scale table are based on "
"participants' sum scores or mean scores across items."
msgstr ""
"Apakah rerata dan deviasi standar di tabel skala berdasarkan skor jumlah "
"peserta atau skor rerata seluruh item."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "participants' sum scores"
msgstr "skor jumlah peserta"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "participants' mean scores"
msgstr "skor rerata peserta"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Item statistics"
msgstr "Statistik item"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "McDonald's ω_t (if item dropped)"
msgstr "ω_t McDonald (jika item dihapus)"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Posterior point estimate of ω_t for the remaining items when this item is "
"dropped. The model is refit once per item."
msgstr ""
"Estimasi titik posterior dari ω_t untuk item tersisa ketika item ini "
"dihapus. Model disesuaikan ulang sekali per item."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "McDonald's ω_h (if item dropped)"
msgstr "ω_h McDonald (jika item dihapus)"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Posterior point estimate of ω_h for the remaining items when this item is "
"dropped. Not available for the correlated-factors model."
msgstr ""
"Estimasi titik posterior dari ω_h untuk item tersisa ketika item ini "
"dihapus. Tidak tersedia untuk model faktor terkorelasi."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Item-rest correlation"
msgstr "Korelasi sisa-item"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Pearson correlation between each item and the sum of the remaining items."
msgstr "Korelasi Pearson antara setiap item dan jumlah item tersisa."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Plot Posteriors"
msgstr "Posterior Diagram"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Display posterior density plots for the reliability coefficients."
msgstr "Tampilkan diagram kepadatan posterior untuk koefisien reliabilitas."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Fix range to 0-1"
msgstr "Perbaiki rentang ke 0-1"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Fix the x-axis of the posterior plots to [0, 1] for easier comparison "
"between coefficients."
msgstr ""
"Perbaiki sumbu-x dari diagram posterior ke [0, 1] untuk perbandingan lebih "
"mudah antara koefisien."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Display Priors"
msgstr "Tampilkan Priori"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Add the prior distribution to the posterior density plot."
msgstr "Tambahkan distribusi priori ke diagram kepadatan posterior."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Probability for:"
msgstr "Probabilitas untuk:"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Report the posterior probability that a reliability coefficient falls within "
"the specified interval."
msgstr ""
"Laporkan probabilitas posterior bahwa koefisien reliabilitas terletak dalam "
"interval tertentu."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Lower bound of the reliability interval."
msgstr "Batas bawah dari interval reliabilitas."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "< Reliability <"
msgstr "< Keandalan <"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Upper bound of the reliability interval."
msgstr "Batas atas dari interval reliabilitas."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Shade posterior region in plot"
msgstr "Wilayah posterior arsir di diagram"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Shade the posterior region corresponding to the probability interval in the "
"density plot."
msgstr ""
"Arsirkan wilayah posterior sesuai dengan interval probabilitas di diagram "
"kepadatan."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Model fit"
msgstr "Penyesuaian model"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Posterior predictive check"
msgstr "Pemeriksaan prediktif posterior"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Graphical check of factor model fit: eigenvalues of the observed covariance "
"matrix are compared against the model-implied posterior distribution."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan grafik dari kesesuaian model faktor: nilai eigen dari matriks "
"kovarians terobservasi dibandingkan terhadap distribusi posterior "
"terimplikasi model."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Fit measures"
msgstr "Sesuaikan pengukuran"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Bayesian fit measures for the factor model: B-LR, B-SRMR, and B-RMSEA with a "
"posterior probability relative to the cutoff."
msgstr ""
"Pengukuran kesesuaian Bayes untuk model faktor: B-LR, B-SRMR, dan B-RMSEA "
"dengan probabilitas posterior relatif dengan ambang batas."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Width of the credible interval for the fit measures."
msgstr "Lebar dari interval kredibel untuk pengukuran kesesuaian."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "p(RMSEA <"
msgstr "p(RMSEA <"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Cutoff for the posterior probability that the B-RMSEA is below this value."
msgstr ""
"Ambang batas untuk probabilitas posterior bahwa B-RMSEA di bawah nilai ini."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ")"
msgstr ")"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Reverse-Scaled Items"
msgstr "Item Terskala-Balik"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Normal-Scaled Items"
msgstr "Item Terskala-Normal"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Items assigned here are recoded (reverse-scored) before the analysis."
msgstr "Item ditugaskan di sini direkam (skor terbalik) sebelum analisis."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Priors"
msgstr "Priori"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Measurement level"
msgstr "Tingkat pengukuran"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Priors on the measurement-level parameters: item residual variances and item "
"factor loadings."
msgstr ""
"Mempriorikan pada parameter tingkat pengukuran: varians residu item dan "
"pemuatan faktor item."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Residual variances: Inverse gamma"
msgstr "Varians residu: Gamma invers"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "shape"
msgstr "bentuk"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Shape parameter of the inverse gamma prior on the item residual variances."
msgstr "Parameter bentuk dari priori gamma invers pada varians residu item."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "scale"
msgstr "skala"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Scale parameter of the inverse gamma prior on the item residual variances."
msgstr "Parameter skala dari priori gamma invers pada varians residu item."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Loadings: Normal"
msgstr "Pemuatan: Normal"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "mean"
msgstr "rerata"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Mean of the normal prior on the item factor loadings."
msgstr "Rerata dari priori normal pada pemuatan faktor item."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "variance scaling"
msgstr "penskalaan varians"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Scales the variance of the normal prior on the item factor loadings. The "
"prior is conditional on the item residual variance, so a loading has prior "
"standard deviation sqrt(residual variance x variance scaling); larger values "
"mean a less informative prior."
msgstr ""
"Menskalakan varians dari priori normal pada pemuatan faktor item. Priori "
"kondisional pada varians residu item, sehingga pemuatan memiliki deviasi "
"standar priori sqrt(varians residu x penskalaan varians); nilai lebih besar "
"berarti priori informatif berkurang."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Structural level"
msgstr "Tingkat struktural"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Priors on the structural parameters of the second-order and bi-factor "
"models: latent residual variances, structural loadings, and the general "
"factor variance."
msgstr ""
"Mempriorikan pada parameter strukturan dari model urutan kedua dan bi-"
"faktor: varians residu laten, pemuatan strukturan, dan varians faktor umum."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Shape parameter of the inverse gamma prior on the latent residual variances."
msgstr "Parameter bentuk dari priori gamma invers pada varians residu laten."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Scale parameter of the inverse gamma prior on the latent residual variances."
msgstr "Parameter skala dari priori gamma invers pada varians residu laten."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Mean of the normal prior on the structural loadings of the group factors on "
"the general factor."
msgstr ""
"Rerata dari priori normal pada pemuatan struktural dari faktor grup pada "
"faktor umum."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Scales the variance of the normal prior on the structural loadings of the "
"group factors on the general factor. Larger values mean a less informative "
"prior."
msgstr ""
"Menskalakan varians dari priori normal pada pemuatan struktural dari faktor "
"grup pada faktor umum. Nilai lebih besar berarti priori informatif berkurang."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Factor variance: Inverse gamma"
msgstr "Varians faktor: Gamma invers"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Shape parameter of the inverse gamma prior on the general factor variance."
msgstr "Parameter bentuk dari priori gamma invers pada varians faktor umum."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Scale parameter of the inverse gamma prior on the general factor variance."
msgstr "Parameter skala dari priori gamma invers pada varians faktor umum."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Latent correlations"
msgstr "Korelasi laten"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Correlation matrix: Inverse-Wishart"
msgstr "Matriks korelasi: Wishart-Invers"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "degrees of freedom"
msgstr "derajat kebebasan"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Degrees of freedom of the inverse Wishart prior on the latent correlation "
"matrix. Values below the number of factors are raised to the number of "
"factors to keep the prior proper."
msgstr ""
"Derajat kebebasan dari priori Wishart invers pada matriks korelasi laten. "
"Nilai di bawah jumlah faktor ditingkatkan ke jumlah faktor untuk menjaga "
"priori sesuai."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "MCMC Options"
msgstr "Opsi MCMC"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "MCMC parameters"
msgstr "Parameter MCMC"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "No. samples"
msgstr "Jml. sampel"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Total number of MCMC samples per chain, including burn-in."
msgstr "Jumlah total dari sampel MCMC per rantai, termasuk burn-in."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "No. burnin samples"
msgstr "Jml. sampel burnin"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Initial samples discarded while the chain converges to the posterior."
msgstr "Sampel inisial dibuang ketika rantai mengonvergensi ke posterior."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Thinning"
msgstr "Penipisan"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Keep every k-th sample to reduce autocorrelation. A value of 1 keeps all "
"samples."
msgstr ""
"Jaga setiap sampel ke-k untuk mengurangi korelasi otomatis. Nilai dari 1 "
"menjaga semua sampel."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "No. chains"
msgstr "Jml. rantai"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Number of independent MCMC chains. Multiple chains enable R-hat convergence "
"diagnostics."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah rantai MCMC independen. Beberapa rantai mengaktifkan diagnostik "
"konvergensi R-hat."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "Diagnostik"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "R-hat"
msgstr "R-hat"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Potential scale reduction factor. Values close to 1 (< 1.1) indicate "
"convergence across chains."
msgstr ""
"Faktor reduksi skala potensial. Nilai terdekat dengan 1 (< 1.1) "
"mengindikasikan konvergensi seluruh rantai."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Traceplots"
msgstr "Diagram lacak"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Plot of sampled values per chain over iterations. Well-mixed chains indicate "
"convergence."
msgstr ""
"Diagram dari nilai bersampel per rantai terhadap iterasi. Rantai bercampur "
"baik mengindikasikan konvergensi."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Repeatability"
msgstr "Perulangan"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Set seed"
msgstr "Atur benih"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Fix the random number generator seed to make the MCMC results reproducible."
msgstr ""
"Perbaiki benih generator angka acak untuk membuat hasil MCMC dapat "
"direproduksi."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Samples"
msgstr "Sampel"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Disable saving samples"
msgstr "Nonaktifkan menyimpan sampel"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"When checked, MCMC samples are not stored in the output file. Reduces file "
"size but re-running the analysis or changing options requires resampling."
msgstr ""
"Ketika diperiksa, sampel MCMC tidak disimpan di berkas luaran. Mengurangi "
"ukuran berkas tetapi menjalankan ulang analisis atau mengubah opsi "
"memerlukan pensampelan ulang."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Advanced Options"
msgstr "Opsi Lanjutan"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Posterior Point Estimate"
msgstr "Estimasi Titik Posterior"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Whether to report the posterior mean or median as the point estimate in the "
"tables."
msgstr ""
"Apakah untuk melaporkan rerata atau median posterior sebagai estimasi titik "
"di tabel."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Mean"
msgstr "Rerata"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Median"
msgstr "Median"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Missing Values"
msgstr "Nilai Hilang"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Bayesian imputation treats missing values as unknown parameters sampled from "
"the posterior; listwise deletion removes any row with a missing value."
msgstr ""
"Imputasi Bayes memperlakukan nilai hilang sebagai parameter tidak diketahui "
"disampelkan dari posterior; penghapusan berdaftar menghapus baris dengan "
"nilai hilang apa pun."

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Bayesian imputation"
msgstr "Imputasi Bayes"

msgctxt "ReliabilityMultidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Exclude cases listwise"
msgstr "Kecualikan kasus berdaftar"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "Variabel"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Items/variables to include in the reliability analysis. Must be scale "
"variables."
msgstr ""
"Item/variabel disertakan di analisis reliabilitas. Harus berupa variabel "
"skala."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Analysis"
msgstr "Analisis"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Scale Statistics"
msgstr "Statistik Skala"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Reliability coefficients and descriptive statistics computed for the full "
"scale."
msgstr ""
"Koefisien reliabilitas dan statistik deskriptif dihitung untuk skala penuh."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Credible interval"
msgstr "Interval kredibel"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Width of the credible interval for scale reliability statistics."
msgstr "Lebari dari interval kredibel untuk statistik reliabilitas skala."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "McDonald's ω"
msgstr "ω McDonald"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"McDonald's omega for unidimensional data based on the single-factor model."
msgstr "Omega McDonald untuk data unidimensi berdasarkan model faktor tunggal."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Cronbach's α"
msgstr "α Cronbach"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Cronbach's alpha. For binary items this equals KR-20."
msgstr "Alfa Cronbach. Untuk item biner ini sama dengan KR-20."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Guttman's λ2"
msgstr "λ2 Guttman"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Guttman's lambda 2, a lower bound for reliability."
msgstr "Lambda 2 Guttman, batas bawah untuk reliabilitas."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Split-half coefficient"
msgstr "Koefisien terpisah-setengah"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Splits items into two halves (odd/even by default). Unstandardized: Flanagan-"
"Rulon; Standardized: Spearman-Brown."
msgstr ""
"Memisahkan item menjadi dua bagian (ganjil/genap secara bawaan). Tidak "
"terstandardisasi: Flanagan-Rulon; Terstandardisasi: Spearman-Brown."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Average interitem correlation"
msgstr "Korelasi interitem rata-rata"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Mean of all pairwise Pearson correlations between items."
msgstr "Rerata dari semua korelasi Pearson berpasangan antara item."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Mean"
msgstr "Rerata"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Variance"
msgstr "Varians"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "SD"
msgstr "SD"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Whether the mean, variance, and SD are based on sum scores or mean scores "
"across items."
msgstr ""
"Apakah rerata, varians, dan SD berdasarkan skor jumlah atau skor rerata "
"seluruh item."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "of participants' sum scores"
msgstr "dari skor jumlah peserta"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "of participants' mean scores"
msgstr "dari skor rerata peserta"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Individual Item Statistics"
msgstr "Statistik Item Individu"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Reliability coefficients and descriptive statistics per item, including "
"posterior distributions when that item is removed."
msgstr ""
"Koefisien reliabilitas dan statistik deskriptif per item, menyertakan "
"distribusi posterior ketika item itu dihapus."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Width of the credible interval for item-level statistics."
msgstr "Lebar dari interval kredibel untuk statistik tingkat item."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "McDonald's ω (if item dropped)"
msgstr "ω McDonald (jika item dihapus)"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Posterior distribution of omega for the remaining items when this item is "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"Distribusi posterior dari omega untuk item tersisa ketika item ini dihapus."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Cronbach's α (if item dropped)"
msgstr "α Cronbach (jika item dihapus)"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Posterior distribution of alpha for the remaining items when this item is "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"Distribusi posterior dari alfa untuk item tersisa ketika item ini dihapus."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Guttman's λ2 (if item dropped)"
msgstr "λ2 Guttman (jika item dihapus)"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Posterior distribution of lambda 2 for the remaining items when this item is "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"Distribusi posterior dari lambda 2 untuk item tersisa ketika item ini "
"dihapus."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Split-half coefficient (if item dropped)"
msgstr "Koefisien terpisah-setengah (jika item dihapus)"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Posterior distribution of the split-half coefficient for the remaining items "
"when this item is removed."
msgstr ""
"Distribusi posterior dari koefisien terpisah sebagian untuk item tersisa "
"ketika item ini dihapus."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "If item dropped plot"
msgstr "Diagram jika item dihapus"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Displays posterior densities of the reliability of the remaining items when "
"each item is dropped."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan kepadatan posterior reliabilitas dari item tersisa ketika setiap "
"item dihapus."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Order items"
msgstr "Item urutan"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Sort the densities by how much removing an item changes the posterior (by "
"mean, KL-divergence, or KS-distance)."
msgstr ""
"Sortir kepadatan dengan seberapa banyak menghapus item mengubah posterior "
"(dengan arti, divergensi-KL, atau jarak-KS)."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Order items by mean"
msgstr "Item urutan berdasarkan rerata"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Order items by KL-divergence"
msgstr "Item urutan berdasarkan divergensi-KL"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Order items by KS-distance"
msgstr "Item urutan berdasarkan jarak-KL"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Item-rest correlation"
msgstr "Korelasi sisa-item"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Correlation of each item with the sum of the remaining items."
msgstr "Korelasi dari setiap item dengan jumlah item tersisa."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Plot Posteriors"
msgstr "Posterior Diagram"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Display posterior density plots for the selected reliability coefficients."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan diagram kepadatan posterior untuk koefisien reliabilitas dipilih."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Fix range to 0-1"
msgstr "Perbaiki rentang ke 0-1"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Fix the x-axis of the posterior plots to [0, 1] for easier comparison "
"between coefficients."
msgstr ""
"Perbaiki sumbu-x dari diagram posterior ke [0, 1] untuk perbandingan lebih "
"mudah antara koefisien."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Display Priors"
msgstr "Tampilkan Priori"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Add the prior distribution to the posterior density plot."
msgstr "Tambahkan distribusi priori ke diagram kepadatan posterior."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Probability for:"
msgstr "Probabilitas untuk:"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Report the prior and posterior probability that a reliability coefficient "
"falls within the specified interval."
msgstr ""
"Laporkan probabilitas priori dan posterior bahwa koefisien reliabilitas "
"terletak dalam interval tertentu."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "< Reliability <"
msgstr "< Keandalan <"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Shade posterior region in plot"
msgstr "Wilayah posterior arsir di diagram"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Shade the posterior region corresponding to the probability interval in the "
"density plot."
msgstr ""
"Arsirkan wilayah posterior sesuai dengan interval probabilitas di diagram "
"kepadatan."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Convergence"
msgstr "Konvergensi"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "MCMC parameters"
msgstr "Parameter MCMC"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Parameters controlling the MCMC sampler used to estimate the posterior "
"distributions."
msgstr ""
"Parameter mengontrol pensampel MCMC digunakan untuk mengestimasikan "
"distribusi posterior."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "No. samples"
msgstr "Jml. sampel"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Total number of MCMC iterations per chain, including burn-in. The number of "
"retained posterior samples per chain is ceiling((samples - burn-in) / "
"thinning)."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah total iterasi MCMC per rantai, termasuk burn-in. Jumlah sampel "
"posterior dipertahankan per rantai adalah plafon((sampel - burn-in) / "
"penipisan)."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "No. burnin samples"
msgstr "Jml. sampel burnin"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Initial samples discarded while the chain converges to the posterior."
msgstr "Sampel inisial dibuang ketika rantai mengonvergensi ke posterior."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Thinning"
msgstr "Penipisan"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Keep every k-th sample to reduce autocorrelation. A value of 1 keeps all "
"samples."
msgstr ""
"Jaga setiap sampel ke-k untuk mengurangi korelasi otomatis. Nilai dari 1 "
"menjaga semua sampel."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "No. chains"
msgstr "Jml. rantai"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Number of independent MCMC chains. Multiple chains enable R-hat convergence "
"diagnostics."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah rantai MCMC independen. Beberapa rantai mengaktifkan diagnostik "
"konvergensi R-hat."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "Diagnostik"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"MCMC convergence diagnostics to assess whether the sampler has converged to "
"the posterior."
msgstr ""
"Diagnostik konvergensi MCMC untuk mengevaluasi apakah pensampel telah "
"dikonvergensikan ke posterior."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "R-hat"
msgstr "R-hat"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Potential scale reduction factor. Values close to 1 (< 1.1) indicate "
"convergence across chains."
msgstr ""
"Faktor reduksi skala potensial. Nilai terdekat dengan 1 (< 1.1) "
"mengindikasikan konvergensi seluruh rantai."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Traceplots"
msgstr "Diagram lacak"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Plot of sampled values per chain over iterations. Well-mixed chains indicate "
"convergence."
msgstr ""
"Diagram dari nilai bersampel per rantai terhadap iterasi. Rantai bercampur "
"baik mengindikasikan konvergensi."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "ESS"
msgstr "ESS"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Effective sample size: number of independent posterior samples after "
"accounting for autocorrelation."
msgstr ""
"Ukuran sampel efektif: jumlah sampel posterior independen setelah menghitung "
"untuk korelasi otomatis."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Repeatability"
msgstr "Perulangan"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Set a random seed to reproduce identical posterior samples across runs."
msgstr ""
"Atur benih acak untuk mereproduksikan sampel posterior identik sama seluruh "
"perjalanan."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Set seed"
msgstr "Atur benih"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Samples"
msgstr "Sampel"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Disable saving samples"
msgstr "Nonaktifkan menyimpan sampel"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"When checked, MCMC samples are not stored in the output file. Reduces file "
"size but may slow down re-running the analysis, because samples are "
"precomputed and cached for speed."
msgstr ""
"Ketika diperiksa, sampel MCMC tidak disimpan di berkas luaran. Mengurangi "
"ukuran berkas tetapi mungkin memperlambat menjalankan ulang analisis, karena "
"sampel diprahitung dan dihapus untuk kecepatan."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Reverse-Scaled Items"
msgstr "Item Terskala-Balik"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Normal-Scaled Items"
msgstr "Item Terskala-Normal"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Priors"
msgstr "Priori"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "CTT-Coefficients (α, λ2)"
msgstr "Koefisien-CTT (α, λ2)"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"The prior on alpha, lambda 2, and the split-half is induced by an inverse "
"Wishart prior on the covariance matrix."
msgstr ""
"Priori pada alfa, lambda 2, dan terpisah sebagian diinduksi oleh priori "
"Wishart invers pada matriks kovarians."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Inverse Wishart scale"
msgstr "Skala Wishart terbalik"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Precision values on the diagonal of the inverse Wishart scaling matrix."
msgstr "Nilai presisi pada diagonal dari matriks penskalaan Wishart invers."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Inverse Wishart df"
msgstr "Df Wishart terbalik"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Degrees of freedom of the inverse Wishart prior. Minimum equals the number "
"of items."
msgstr ""
"Derajat kebebasan dari priori Wishart invers. Minimum sama dengan jumlah "
"item."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"The prior on omega is induced by an inverse gamma on residual variances and "
"a normal prior on factor loadings."
msgstr ""
"Priori pada omega diinduksikan oleh gamma invers pada varians residu dan "
"priori normal pada pemuatan faktor."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Inverse gamma:"
msgstr "Gamma terbalik:"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "shape"
msgstr "bentuk"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Shape parameter of the inverse gamma prior on residual variances."
msgstr "Parameter bentuk dari priori gamma invers pada varians residu."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "scale"
msgstr "skala"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Scale parameter of the inverse gamma prior on residual variances."
msgstr "Parameter skala dari priori gamma invers pada varians residu."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Normal:"
msgstr "Normal:"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "mean"
msgstr "rerata"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Mean of the normal prior on factor loadings."
msgstr "Rerata dari priori normal pada pemuatan faktor."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Advanced Options"
msgstr "Opsi Lanjutan"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Missing Values"
msgstr "Nilai Hilang"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Bayesian imputation treats missing values as unknown parameters sampled from "
"the posterior; listwise deletion removes any row with a missing value."
msgstr ""
"Imputasi Bayes memperlakukan nilai hilang sebagai parameter tidak diketahui "
"disampelkan dari posterior; penghapusan berdaftar menghapus baris dengan "
"nilai hilang apa pun."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Bayesian imputation"
msgstr "Imputasi Bayes"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Exclude cases listwise"
msgstr "Kecualikan kasus berdaftar"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "McDonald's ω Estimation"
msgstr "Estimasi ω McDonald"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Options for fitting the single-factor model underlying McDonald's omega."
msgstr "Opsi untuk menyesuaikan model faktor tunggal mendasari omega McDonald."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Posterior predictive check"
msgstr "Pemeriksaan prediktif posterior"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Graphical check for single-factor model fit: eigenvalues of the observed "
"covariance matrix are compared against the model-implied posterior "
"distribution."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan grafik untuk kesesuaian model faktor tunggal: nilai eigen dari "
"matriks kovarians terobservasi dibandingkan terhadap distribusi posterior "
"terimplikasi model."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Fit measures"
msgstr "Sesuaikan pengukuran"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Bayesian fit indices (B-LR, B-RMSEA, B-CFI, B-TLI) for the single-factor "
"model with probability statements relative to cutoffs."
msgstr ""
"Indeks kesesuaian Bayes (B-LR, B-RMSEA, B-CFI, B-TLI) untuk model faktor "
"tunggal dengan pernyataan probabilitas relatif dengan ambang batas."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "p(RMSEA <"
msgstr "p(RMSEA <"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ")"
msgstr ")"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "p(CFI/TLI >"
msgstr "p(CFI/TLI >"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Standardized factor loadings"
msgstr "Pemuatan faktor terstandardisasi"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Table of standardized loadings from the single-factor model (posterior mean "
"or median)."
msgstr ""
"Tabel dari pemuatan terstandardisasi dari model faktor tunggal (rerata atau "
"median posterior)."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Coefficients"
msgstr "Koefisien"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Unstandardized uses the covariance matrix; standardized uses the correlation "
"matrix. Standardized alpha is contested in the literature."
msgstr ""
"Tidak terstandardisasi menggunakan matriks kovarians; terstandardisasi "
"menggunakan matriks korelasi. Alfa terstandardisasi dikonteskan di literatur."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Unstandardized"
msgstr "Tidak terstandardisasi"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Standardized"
msgstr "Terstandardisasi"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Posterior Point Estimate"
msgstr "Estimasi Titik Posterior"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Whether to report the posterior mean or median as the point estimate in the "
"tables."
msgstr ""
"Apakah untuk melaporkan rerata atau median posterior sebagai estimasi titik "
"di tabel."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalBayesian|"
msgid "Median"
msgstr "Median"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "Variabel"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"Items/variables to include in the reliability analysis. Must be scale "
"variables."
msgstr ""
"Item/variabel disertakan di analisis reliabilitas. Harus berupa variabel "
"skala."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Analysis"
msgstr "Analisis"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Scale Statistics"
msgstr "Statistik Skala"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"Reliability coefficients and descriptive statistics computed for the full "
"scale."
msgstr ""
"Koefisien reliabilitas dan statistik deskriptif dihitung untuk skala penuh."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Confidence interval"
msgstr "Interval kepercayaan"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Coverage of the confidence intervals for scale reliability statistics."
msgstr "Cakupan dari interval kepercayaan untuk statistik reliabilitas skala."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "McDonald's ω"
msgstr "ω McDonald"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"McDonald's omega for unidimensional data based on the single-factor model. "
"The denominator uses model-implied total variance."
msgstr ""
"Omega McDonald untuk data unidimensi berdasarkan model faktor tunggal. "
"Denominator menggunakan varians total terimplikasi model."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Cronbach's α"
msgstr "α Cronbach"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Cronbach's alpha. For binary items this equals KR-20."
msgstr "Alfa Cronbach. Untuk item biner ini sama dengan KR-20."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Guttman's λ2"
msgstr "λ2 Guttman"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Guttman's lambda 2, a lower bound for reliability."
msgstr "Lambda 2 Guttman, batas bawah untuk reliabilitas."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Split-half coefficient"
msgstr "Koefisien terpisah-setengah"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"Splits items into two halves (odd/even by default). Unstandardized: Flanagan-"
"Rulon coefficient; Standardized: Spearman-Brown coefficient."
msgstr ""
"Memisahkan item menjadi dua bagian (ganjil/genap secara bawaan). Tidak "
"terstandardisasi: Koefisien Flanagan-Rulon; Terstandardisasi: Koefisien "
"Spearman-Brown."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Average interitem correlation"
msgstr "Korelasi interitem rata-rata"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Mean of all pairwise Pearson correlations between items."
msgstr "Rerata dari semua korelasi Pearson berpasangan antara item."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Mean"
msgstr "Rerata"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Variance"
msgstr "Varians"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "SD"
msgstr "SD"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"Whether the mean, variance, and SD are based on sum scores or mean scores "
"across items."
msgstr ""
"Apakah rerata, varians, dan SD berdasarkan skor jumlah atau skor rerata "
"seluruh item."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "of participants' sum scores"
msgstr "dari skor jumlah peserta"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "of participants' mean scores"
msgstr "dari skor rerata peserta"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Individual Item Statistics"
msgstr "Statistik Item Individu"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"Reliability coefficients and descriptive statistics per item, including what-"
"if statistics when that item is removed."
msgstr ""
"Koefisien reliabilitas dan statistik deskriptif per item, menyertakan "
"statistika jika-apa ketika item itu dihapus."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Coverage of the confidence intervals for item-level statistics."
msgstr "Cakupan dari interval kepercayaan untuk statistik tingkat item."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "McDonald's ω  (if item dropped)"
msgstr "ω McDonald  (jika item dihapus)"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Omega of the remaining items when this item is removed from the scale."
msgstr "Omega dari item tersisa ketika item ini dihapus dari skala."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Cronbach's α (if item dropped)"
msgstr "α Cronbach (jika item dihapus)"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Alpha of the remaining items when this item is removed from the scale."
msgstr "Alfa dari item tersisa ketika item ini dihapus dari skala."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Guttman's λ2 (if item dropped)"
msgstr "λ2 Guttman (jika item dihapus)"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"Lambda 2 of the remaining items when this item is removed from the scale."
msgstr "Lambda 2 dari item tersisa ketika item ini dihapus dari skala."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Split-half coefficient (if item dropped)"
msgstr "Koefisien terpisah-setengah (jika item dihapus)"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"Split-half coefficient of the remaining items when this item is removed from "
"the scale."
msgstr ""
"Koefisien terpisah sebagian dari item tersisa ketika item ini dihapus dari "
"skala."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Item-rest correlation"
msgstr "Korelasi sisa-item"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Correlation of each item with the sum of the remaining items."
msgstr "Korelasi dari setiap item dengan jumlah item tersisa."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Reverse-Scaled Items"
msgstr "Item Terskala-Balik"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Normal-Scaled Items"
msgstr "Item Terskala-Normal"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Advanced Options"
msgstr "Opsi Lanjutan"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Confidence intervals"
msgstr "Interval kepercayaan"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"Control the method used to construct confidence intervals for reliability "
"coefficients, variance, and SD."
msgstr ""
"Kontrol metode digunakan untuk mengonstruksi interval kepercayaan untuk "
"koefisien reliabilitas, varians, dan SD."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Reliability coefficients"
msgstr "Koefisien keandalan"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"Analytic intervals use normal-theory standard errors (van der Ark, 2024). "
"Bootstrapped intervals use percentile resampling."
msgstr ""
"Interval analitik menggunakan galat standar teori normal (van der Ark, "
"2024). Interval terbootstrap menggunakan pensampelan ulang persentil."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Analytic interval"
msgstr "Interval analitis"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Bootstrapped interval"
msgstr "Interval terbootstrap"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "No. of bootstrap samples"
msgstr "Jml. sampel bootstrap"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"Number of bootstrap replications. Higher values yield more stable interval "
"estimates."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah replikasi bootstrap. Nilai lebih tinggi menghasilkan estimasi "
"interval lebih stabil."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"Non-parametric bootstrap resamples the data; parametric bootstrap samples "
"from a multivariate normal with the estimated parameters."
msgstr ""
"Bootstrap non-parametris menyampelkan ulang data; bootstrap parametris "
"menyampelkan dari normal multivariat dengan parameter terestimasi."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Non-parametric bootstrap"
msgstr "Bootstrap non-parametris"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Parametric bootstrap"
msgstr "Bootstrap parametris"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Variance and SD"
msgstr "Varians dan SD"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"Chi-square-based intervals assume normality; non-parametric intervals use a "
"two-step bootstrap procedure (van der Ark, 2024)."
msgstr ""
"Interval berbasis chi-kuadrat mengasumsikan normalitas; interval non-"
"parametris menggunakan prosedur bootstrap dua langkah (van der Ark, 2024)."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Chisq-based"
msgstr "Berbasis-Chisq"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Non-parametric"
msgstr "Non-parametris"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "McDonald's ω Estimation"
msgstr "Estimasi ω McDonald"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"CFA fits the single-factor model via confirmatory factor analysis; PFA uses "
"principal factor analysis."
msgstr ""
"CFA menyesuaikan model faktor tunggal melalui analisis faktor konfirmater; "
"PFA menggunakan analisis faktor prinsip."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "CFA"
msgstr "CFA"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Single factor model fit"
msgstr "Penyesuaian model satu faktor"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"Chi-square test, RMSEA, SRMR and other fit indices for the single-factor "
"model underlying omega."
msgstr ""
"Uji chi-kuadrat, RMSEA, SRMR dan indeks penyesuaian lain untuk model faktor "
"tunggal mendasari omega."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "PFA"
msgstr "PFA"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Standardized factor loadings"
msgstr "Pemuatan faktor terstandardisasi"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Table of standardized loadings from the single-factor model."
msgstr "Tabel dari pemuatan terstandardisasi dari model faktor tunggal."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Coefficients"
msgstr "Koefisien"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"Unstandardized coefficients use the raw covariance matrix; standardized use "
"the correlation matrix."
msgstr ""
"Koefisien tidak terstandardisasi menggunakan matriks kovarians mentah; "
"terstandardisasi menggunakan matriks korelasi."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Unstandardized"
msgstr "Tidak terstandardisasi"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Standardized"
msgstr "Terstandardisasi"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Missing Values"
msgstr "Nilai Hilang"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"Pairwise uses all available observations per covariance pair; listwise "
"deletes any row with a missing value."
msgstr ""
"Berpasangan menggunakan semua observasi tersedia per pasangan kovarians; "
"berdaftar menghapus baris dengan nilai hilang apa pun."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Pairwise"
msgstr "Berpasangan"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Delete listwise"
msgstr "Hapus daftar"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Repeatability"
msgstr "Perulangan"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Set a random seed to reproduce the same bootstrap results across runs."
msgstr ""
"Atur benih acak untuk mereproduksikan hasil bootstrap sama seluruh "
"perjalanan."

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Set seed"
msgstr "Atur benih"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Samples"
msgstr "Sampel"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid "Do not save samples"
msgstr "Jangan simpan sampel"

msgctxt "ReliabilityUnidimensionalFrequentist|"
msgid ""
"When checked, bootstrap samples are not stored in the output file. This "
"reduces file size but may slow down re-running the analysis, because samples "
"are precomputed and cached for speed."
msgstr ""
"Ketika diperiksa, sampel bootstrap tidak disimpan di berkas luaran. Ini "
"mengurangi ukuran berkas tetapi mungkin memperlambat menjalankan ulang "
"analisis, karena sampel diprahitung dan dihapus untuk kecepatan."
